// Lily# bug (2026-10-04): a staff hidden with removeEmpty, with a lyrics row under it.
// (OmrGen's lied008, seed 7.) The voice rests through bars 10-14, the third system: its staff
// is hidden there, but its whole-measure rests are drawn on the piano's upper staff, over the
// right hand's notes.
// (Without the score's "lyrics vowords" row this piece happens to draw right, but the hidden
// voice's rests land on the piano's staff without lyrics too: OmrGen's plain lied002, seed 7.)
// Seen too in lied002 (removeEmpty all, the voice resting through the first system): the
// voice's rests drawn on the piano's upper staff there, and the lyrics row of the systems
// after it standing under the piano's lower staff instead of under the voice.
